<title>USA: J.C. Penney final Eckerd proration 60.7 pct.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney final Eckerd proration 60.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, TEX. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Penney Co said Tuesday that 35,279,919 common shares of Eckerd Corp were accepted in Penney's tender offer for Eckerd.</p>
<p>The offer, made by Penney's Omega Acquisition Corp unit, resulted in Penney owning about 50.1 percent of Eckerd's outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>Payment for the offer, which ended at midnight December 6, is now being made, Penney said.</p>
<p>Penney said last week it expected to complete the $3.3 billion cash-and-stock acquisition of Eckerd in the first quarter of 1997. It announced the acquisition in November.</p>
